Z||000002||Robert||08-10-2001||06:51 PM||||Worked this time.  <BR>This is a signature from a mustang group I belong to.<BR>I thought this was a great way to show what’s been done to your car, plus let everyone else know where the parts came from.<P><BR><A HREF="http://www.netsnapshot.com/users/842/images/Oyj4lcCoBQIAAGtIi20_842_46.jpg" TARGET=_blank>1990 GT Hatch:</A> <A HREF="http://www.worldcastings.com/sbford.html" TARGET=_blank>Stage I Windsor Jr. heads</A>, <A HREF="http://www.harlandsharp.com/Ford.html" TARGET=_blank>1.6 Roller Rockers</A>, <A HREF="http://www.netsnapshot.com/users/842/images/Oyj4lcCoBQIAAGtIi20_842_65.jpg" TARGET=_blank>GT40 intake port matched to heads</A>, <A HREF="http://www.fordracing.com/performanceparts" TARGET=_blank>65mm TB</A>, <A HREF="http://www.pro-flow.com/styles.htm" TARGET=_blank>75mm Pro-M Bullet</A>, <A HREF="http://www.fordracing.com/performanceparts" TARGET=_blank>24lb. injectors</A>, <A HREF="http://www.maximummotorsports.com/fuelregulator.html" TARGET=_blank>Kirban adj. FPR</A>, <A HREF="http://www.maximummotorsports.com/fuelpump.html" TARGET=_blank>190lph pump</A>, <A HREF="http://www.fordracing.com/performanceparts" TARGET=_blank>E-303 cam</A>, <A HREF="http://www.fordracing.com/performanceparts" TARGET=_blank>FMS timing set</A>, <A HREF="http://www.brothersperformance.com/shop/_images/exhaust.jpg" TARGET=_blank>BBK 1-5/8" uneq. shorty headers</A>, <A HREF="http://www.bassani.com/ART/EC/1457-1723-4697-3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Bassani cat X-pipe</A>, removed air silencer, <A HREF="http://www.knfilters.com/airfiltr.htm" TARGET=_blank>K&N filter</A>, <A HREF="http://www.maximummotorsports.com/springs.html" TARGET=_blank>H&R 'Race' front</A> & <A HREF="http://www.eibach.com/default.asp" TARGET=_blank>Eibach Pro-Kit rear</A> springs, <A HREF="http://www.bilstein.com/" TARGET=_blank>Bilstein Sport (H1) struts/shocks</A>, GW Caster plates, <A HREF="http://www.maximummotorsports.com/sfc.html" TARGET=_blank>MM sub-frames</A>, <A HREF="http://www.maximummotorsports.com/images/large/MMRLCA1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>MM Lower Control Arms</A>,  <A HREF="http://www.netsnapshot.com/users/842/images/Oyj4lcCoBQIAAGtIi20_842_55.jpg" TARGET=_blank>MM strut brace</A>, <A HREF="http://www.stangnet.com/tech/lug.html" TARGET=_blank>5-lug conversion</A>, <A HREF="http://www.netsnapshot.com/users/842/images/Oyj4lcCoBQIAAGtIi20_842_47.jpg" TARGET=_blank>13 Cobra front brake upgrade</A>, <A HREF="http://www.maximummotorsports.com/bhk.html" TARGET=_blank>MM braided lines</A>, <A HREF="http://www.fordracing.com/performanceparts" TARGET=_blank>FMS T5-Z</A>, <A HREF="http://www.springfieldmotorsport.com/images/pro50-2.gif" TARGET=_blank>Pro5.0</A> (in place of the old AOD), <A HREF="http://www.netsnapshot.com/users/842/images/Oyj4lcCoBQIAAGtIi20_842_60.jpg" TARGET=_blank>17x8 '99 Cobra rims with 245/45-17 BFG Comp T/A rubber</A>.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Robert (edited 08-10-2001).]||||reg||1
